    entry regex '^\\d+ ERR'     a pattern
    chunk may have 'req-8f3a'  the chunks that MAY contain it, whole.
                               `may` because a Bloom filter cannot say more
    logline since '12:00'      the timestamps the lines carry
    logline until '13:00'
